          "evidence": "ServiceTitan serves 100,000+ contractors and has launched the Atlas AI platform (September 2025) which leverages aggregate usage data to improve dispatching and marketing automation across all customers. Morgan Stanley upgraded the stock in January 2026 specifically citing an AI and data moat, implying the platform creates improving returns at scale. However, individual contractor usage is largely independent \u2014 the network effect is data-driven rather than direct user-to-user value creation, placing this at moderate rather than strong.",
          "evidence_source": "researched",
          "trajectory": "building"
        },
        {
          "id": "data_advantages",
          "status": "strong",
          "evidence": "ServiceTitan has accumulated operational data from 100,000+ contractors over a decade, including job completion rates, technician performance, dispatch patterns, and pricing data across HVAC, plumbing, electrical, and other trades. The Atlas AI platform (launched September 2025) translates this dataset into AI-driven dispatching and marketing automation. Morgan Stanley's January 2026 upgrade explicitly cited the AI and data moat. Conduit Tech acquisition (2025) adds LiDAR-based HVAC design data. This is a dataset that took years to build and cannot be replicated quickly by a new entrant.",
          "evidence_source": "researched",
          "trajectory": "building"
        },
