          "id": "switching_costs",
          "status": "strong",
          "evidence": "ServiceTitan reported gross dollar retention greater than 95% and net dollar retention greater than 110% for fiscal 2025 (SEC 8-K filings). Customers absorb price increases rather than switch due to deep integration of dispatch workflows, job history, CRM data, financial reporting, and marketing tools. Implementation fees of $10,000-$50,000+ and mandatory annual contracts create structural lock-in. Data migration complexity from years of operational data further entrenches customers.",
          "evidence_source": "researched",
          "trajectory": "stable"
