          "evidence_source": "agent_estimate",
          "trajectory": "stable"
        },
        {
          "id": "cost_structure",
          "status": "moderate",
          "evidence": "ServiceTitan is a publicly traded company with approximately 3,400 employees and significant R&D investment. As a platform serving 100,000+ contractors, it achieves cloud infrastructure scale economies. However, its large headcount and enterprise sales motion create a high cost base. The company is investing aggressively in growth. Cost structure advantage exists at the infrastructure level but is offset by heavy operational spend.",
