          "evidence": "ServiceTitan is the category-defining brand in field service management, described as the #1 software platform for managing a service business with 100,000+ professionals and 12.74% market share in the FSM category (6sense data). Gartner Peer Insights rates it with an analyst score of 85 and excellent user sentiment based on 208 reviews. Investors evaluate all FSM startups against ServiceTitan first. The brand commands a significant trust premium despite higher cost and complexity. Public listing on NASDAQ as TTAN further elevates credibility.",
