          "status": "moderate",
          "evidence": "Jobber integrates with 50+ native tools including QuickBooks, Stripe, Square, Mailchimp, Google Calendar, and Zapier. SMB customers who have embedded Jobber into their invoicing, payment collection, customer portal, and job scheduling workflows face meaningful migration friction. However, Jobber's data exports are relatively clean and the platform is simpler than ServiceTitan, meaning migration is feasible in weeks rather than months for most customers.",
          "evidence_source": "researched",
          "trajectory": "building"
        },
        {
          "id": "regulatory_barriers",
          "status": "absent",
          "evidence": "Jobber operates in unregulated B2B SaaS for SMB field service management. No government licenses, regulated activities, or hard-to-obtain certifications are required. Standard SaaS certifications are achievable by any funded competitor within 12 months.",
          "evidence_source": "agent_estimate",
